            "value": "Volume e brilho"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ses ve parlaklık göstergesi": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lautstärke- und Helligkeitsanzeige"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Volume and brightness indicator"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Indicador de volumen y brillo"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Indicateur de volume et de luminosité"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Indicador de volume e brilho"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ses ve parlaklık tuşlarını Mate Notch işler: macOS'un ortadaki kare göstergesi çıkmaz, gösterge notch'ta görünür. Vermezsen iki gösterge birlikte çıkar; ayarlardan kapatabilirsin.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mate Notch bedient die Lautstärke- und Helligkeitstasten: Das quadratische Overlay von macOS erscheint nicht mehr und die Anzeige erscheint im Notch. Wenn du es überspringst, erscheinen beide Anzeigen zusammen; du kannst das in den Einstellungen ausschalten."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mate Notch handles the volume and brightness keys: macOS's square overlay no longer appears and the indicator shows in the notch. If you skip it, both indicators appear together; you can turn this off in Settings."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mate Notch gestiona las teclas de volumen y brillo: el recuadro de macOS ya no aparece y el indicador se muestra en el notch. Si lo omites, aparecen ambos indicadores a la vez; puedes desactivarlo en Ajustes."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mate Notch gère les touches de volume et de luminosité : le carré de macOS n'apparaît plus et l'indicateur s'affiche dans le notch. Si vous passez cette étape, les deux indicateurs apparaissent ensemble ; vous pouvez le désactiver dans les Réglages."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O Mate Notch controla as teclas de volume e brilho: o quadrado do macOS não aparece mais e o indicador surge no notch. Se você pular, os dois indicadores aparecem juntos; dá para desativar isso nos Ajustes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ses ve parlaklık uç noktalarında tepki versin": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reagieren, wenn Lautstärke oder Helligkeit ein Extrem erreichen"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "React when volume or brightness hits an extreme"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reaccionar cuando el volumen o el brillo llegan a un extremo"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Réagir quand le volume ou la luminosité atteint un extrême"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reagir quando o volume ou o brilho chega a um extremo"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ses çıkışı": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Audioausgabe"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Audio output"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Salida de audio"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sortie audio"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Saída de áudio"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ses, parlaklık ve klavye ışığı değişince macOS'un ortadaki karesi yerine notch'ta şık bir gösterge çıkar. Erişilebilirlik izni verirsen macOS'un kendi göstergesi de gizlenir.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn sich Lautstärke, Helligkeit oder Tastaturlicht ändern, erscheint im Notch eine schlanke Anzeige. Erteile den Zugriff auf Bedienungshilfen, damit auch das Overlay von macOS ausgeblendet wird."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When volume, brightness or keyboard light changes, a sleek indicator appears in the notch. Grant Accessibility access to hide macOS's own overlay too."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cuando cambia el volumen, el brillo o la luz del teclado, aparece un indicador elegante en el notch. Concede acceso a Accesibilidad para ocultar también el recuadro de macOS."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quand le volume, la luminosité ou le rétroéclairage du clavier change, un indicateur élégant apparaît dans le notch. Accordez l'accès à l'Accessibilité pour masquer aussi l'affichage de macOS."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quando volume, brilho ou luz do teclado mudam, um indicador elegante aparece no notch. Conceda acesso à Acessibilidade para ocultar também o painel do macOS."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sesi aç": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ton einschalten"
